      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Settings and player counts are illustrative.\nPublic lobbies never reveal roles. Night actions are private.\nGame Room shows the daytime voting state.\nRoom owners control starting; guests control their readiness.\nThese are static wireframes, not working account or game screens.",
